            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3.04 The Union shall indemnify and save the Employer harmless against any and all claims, demands, suits or other forms of liability that shall arise out of or by reason of action taken or not taken by the Employer in reliance upon such authorization and a list furnished to the Employer by the Union setting forth the amount of dues and initiation fees owing from each employee for the purposes of complying with the provisions of any check off authorization.",
            "block_bbox": [
