        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5.09 The Employer shall notify the Union and the employee in writing not less than one (1) week (Full Time Employees) and three (3) days (Part Time Employees) prior to their being transferred. The Union shall be notified as soon as possible in the case of an emergency transfer.",
